{"id":5364,"date":"2025-08-31T14:10:18","date_gmt":"2025-08-31T07:10:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5364"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:19:13","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:19:13","slug":"amazon-fba-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-amazon\/amazon-fba-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"Amazon FBA l\u00e0 g\u00ec? L\u1ee3i \u00edch, \u01b0u v\u00e0 nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng FBA"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"MzWzdmJ4GozQ4txZTxzlqYUkg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyEedLVj6ouRQUxsbUrlSqTjgPe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi kinh doanh tr\u00ean Amazon, vi\u1ec7c x\u1eed l\u00fd kho b\u00e3i v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t. \u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\u00e0y, Amazon \u0111\u00e3 cho ra \u0111\u1eddi <strong>FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon)<\/strong> &#8211; m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00f3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n kh\u1ecfi g\u00e1nh n\u1eb7ng v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng FBA, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eadp trung ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c marketing, trong khi Amazon s\u1ebd lo to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh t\u1eeb l\u01b0u kho \u0111\u1ebfn giao h\u00e0ng. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y,<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 FBA, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh li\u1ec7u \u0111\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh hay kh\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ANATdCqIMoJRdsxfGO5l5YlEglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon FBA l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3924d608-0d27-4ea5-8969-a339cdeb756b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHcSobgdAmoZkF6xaeWvlubtigVc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;HcSobgdAmoZkF6xaeWvlubtigVc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:241780,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5365\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5365\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5365\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/437ec72c-fb8b-4204-8360-e671fba5685a.png\" alt=\"Amazon FBA l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/437ec72c-fb8b-4204-8360-e671fba5685a.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/437ec72c-fb8b-4204-8360-e671fba5685a-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/437ec72c-fb8b-4204-8360-e671fba5685a-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/437ec72c-fb8b-4204-8360-e671fba5685a-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/437ec72c-fb8b-4204-8360-e671fba5685a-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5365\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Amazon FBA l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"MzWzdmJ4GozQ4txZTxzlqYUkg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RNusdd9svoMSWixFxXHlfMvcgDe\"><strong>FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon)<\/strong> l\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 m\u00e0 \u1edf \u0111\u00f3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n g\u1eedi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c trung t\u00e2m ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng (kho) c\u1ee7a Amazon. Sau \u0111\u00f3, Amazon s\u1ebd thay b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 c\u00e1c kh\u00e2u c\u00f2n l\u1ea1i, bao g\u1ed3m: l\u01b0u tr\u1eef h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a, l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 quy tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVOtdQpm1orJg5xSH39l7wyig9e\">S\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i gi\u1eefa FBA v\u00e0 FBM (Fulfillment by Merchant) n\u1eb1m \u1edf ch\u1ed7: v\u1edbi <strong>FBA<\/strong>, Amazon s\u1ebd lo t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c kh\u00e2u v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p, c\u00f2n v\u1edbi <strong>FBM<\/strong>, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ea3i t\u1ef1 m\u00ecnh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CtrgduYnQoQTzcx1g3GlWx49gFf\">FBA ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-SKu7dAJy3oCSEQx9aSSlgRGvgHf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5739a31c-c9a3-4a39-84c9-a4a177d44a4c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FThlXbQPNgoRb1SxrjaYl3iq2grh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ThlXbQPNgoRb1SxrjaYl3iq2grh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:329399,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5739a31c-c9a3-4a39-84c9-a4a177d44a4c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FThlXbQPNgoRb1SxrjaYl3iq2grh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ThlXbQPNgoRb1SxrjaYl3iq2grh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:329399,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5366\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5366\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5366\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e67ec166-c173-4ac0-b7f4-d048cce11527.png\" alt=\"FBA ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e67ec166-c173-4ac0-b7f4-d048cce11527.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e67ec166-c173-4ac0-b7f4-d048cce11527-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e67ec166-c173-4ac0-b7f4-d048cce11527-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e67ec166-c173-4ac0-b7f4-d048cce11527-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e67ec166-c173-4ac0-b7f4-d048cce11527-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5366\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>FBA ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"MzWzdmJ4GozQ4txZTxzlqYUkg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GlIRdVnFAoVpkYxb7UHltK3egMh\">Quy tr\u00ecnh ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a FBA \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Amazon t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, g\u00f3i g\u1ecdn trong 4 b\u01b0\u1edbc ch\u00ednh:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QiV2deRQSoketCxifL9lbMO7glf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: G\u1eedi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn kho Amazon:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb v\u00e0 g\u1eedi h\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n kho c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c kho FBA \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Amazon ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0hCdahYZodubaxo20alqEavgQf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Amazon l\u01b0u tr\u1eef s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Amazon s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn v\u00e0 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch an to\u00e0n trong kho c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd. H\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n kho c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qua h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IJTod8hdPoJoNOxlvYGl5IP1gEe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Amazon \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n:<\/strong> Khi c\u00f3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1eb7t mua s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a Amazon s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng x\u1eed l\u00fd. Nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean kho s\u1ebd l\u1ea5y s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vv4UdRu1XoAGeNxTAfLlcaUZgET\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Amazon x\u1eed l\u00fd d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Amazon s\u1ebd thay m\u1eb7t b\u1ea1n x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, bao g\u1ed3m vi\u1ec7c tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd quy tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3, ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-IucQdKtXxoh5WhxEqVqlWfipgkb\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Amazon FBA<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-NhKKdZ1Zdojye7xTMPWlEur9gHh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e5fcdc3a-bb79-444f-acc7-f3e17abe3db1&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGcQsbzF8to2Fm4xr2ZqlaxBsgCB%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GcQsbzF8to2Fm4xr2ZqlaxBsgCB&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:614408,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e5fcdc3a-bb79-444f-acc7-f3e17abe3db1&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGcQsbzF8to2Fm4xr2ZqlaxBsgCB%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GcQsbzF8to2Fm4xr2ZqlaxBsgCB&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:614408,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5367\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5367\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5367\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df6ee788-4a52-4f56-8969-c1081236b742.png\" alt=\"L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Amazon FBA\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df6ee788-4a52-4f56-8969-c1081236b742.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df6ee788-4a52-4f56-8969-c1081236b742-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df6ee788-4a52-4f56-8969-c1081236b742-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df6ee788-4a52-4f56-8969-c1081236b742-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df6ee788-4a52-4f56-8969-c1081236b742-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5367\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Amazon FBA<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"MzWzdmJ4GozQ4txZTxzlqYUkg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQztdblVXo12a2x6ELell6nugBe\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng FBA mang l\u1ea1i nh\u1eefng l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n mu\u1ed1n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng quy m\u00f4 nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WyKJdClp4oHEfyxpMJ6lhbd4gxd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c:<\/strong> \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ee3i \u00edch l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t. B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i lo l\u1eafng v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c thu\u00ea kho, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i hay x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n. To\u00e0n b\u1ed9 th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u00f3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00e0nh cho vi\u1ec7c nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, marketing v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MZeKdtc5aobEQ5xpdgzl1Yvhgdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eafn nh\u00e3n Prime:<\/strong> C\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m FBA s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n cho Amazon Prime, hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb logo Prime uy t\u00edn. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trung th\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a Prime, nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng chi ti\u00eau nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u01b0\u1edfng giao h\u00e0ng mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed trong 2 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VonfdGZPgo7dsCxQnXEluyrPgpc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u0103ng uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i:<\/strong> Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng tin t\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c &#8220;Fulfilled by Amazon&#8221; h\u01a1n v\u00ec h\u1ecd tin v\u00e0o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u00e0 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 giao h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a Amazon. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n gi\u00e0nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c &#8220;Buy Box&#8221; v\u00e0 t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QzVRdzZooouzCdxWSbYlFkijgbW\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng 24\/7:<\/strong> Amazon c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng 24\/7 \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n gi\u1ea3m b\u1edbt g\u00e1nh n\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 duy tr\u00ec \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t cho gian h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HWJEd0RG0oMP0vx3rAnlaDKagWc\">Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 R\u1ee7i ro c\u1ee7a FBA<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-WOfAdXRcdoHRZbxutrRlKKTqghc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;51d55bf4-ae01-4c11-aedf-99950c7503ba&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJy1Xb9R0vozEa7xl6bWlfRbFgLh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Jy1Xb9R0vozEa7xl6bWlfRbFgLh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:492687,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;51d55bf4-ae01-4c11-aedf-99950c7503ba&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJy1Xb9R0vozEa7xl6bWlfRbFgLh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Jy1Xb9R0vozEa7xl6bWlfRbFgLh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:492687,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5368\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5368\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5368\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/7186e9ec-cc63-44aa-8973-bac0cf8186ab.png\" alt=\"Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 R\u1ee7i ro c\u1ee7a FBA\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/7186e9ec-cc63-44aa-8973-bac0cf8186ab.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/7186e9ec-cc63-44aa-8973-bac0cf8186ab-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/7186e9ec-cc63-44aa-8973-bac0cf8186ab-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/7186e9ec-cc63-44aa-8973-bac0cf8186ab-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/7186e9ec-cc63-44aa-8973-bac0cf8186ab-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5368\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 R\u1ee7i ro c\u1ee7a FBA<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"MzWzdmJ4GozQ4txZTxzlqYUkg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YxoNdXAFwohD0zxEVj2lmNB8gRc\">B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh nh\u1eefng l\u1ee3i \u00edch to l\u1edbn, FBA c\u0169ng \u0111i k\u00e8m v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 r\u1ee7i ro m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jecdd1360obNtdxJ5uvlZM2Wgwf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Chi ph\u00ed cao:<\/strong> FBA kh\u00f4ng h\u1ec1 r\u1ebb. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 nhi\u1ec1u lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed kh\u00e1c nhau (s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1eadp \u1edf ph\u1ea7n sau), c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3 bi\u00ean l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng t\u00ednh to\u00e1n c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gs3YdNpKJouEgpxkOY6ly1Zygob\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp ki\u1ec3m tra ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi n\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. M\u1ecdi quy tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i \u0111\u1ec1u theo ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n c\u1ee7a Amazon, khi\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n kh\u00f3 t\u1ea1o ra tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ri\u00eang.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tj3XdUwo2oQUqdxEoshlTuoGgge\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>R\u1ee7i ro v\u1ec1 t\u1ed3n kho:<\/strong> N\u1ebfu s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n ch\u1eadm, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ed1i m\u1eb7t v\u1edbi ph\u00ed l\u01b0u kho d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n (Long-Term Storage Fees), m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1n k\u00e9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 &#8220;\u0103n m\u00f2n&#8221; l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EEQQdzG5XoMzLRxpDgAlunrFgmF\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o Amazon:<\/strong> To\u00e0n b\u1ed9 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o c\u00e1c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a Amazon, v\u1ed1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 l\u00fac n\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XI2wd04d5oOCcNxH3pQlpCG4geh\">Ph\u00ed FBA v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch t\u00ednh<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UsCWdAHKgoQ8GWxPCW9lC4EegpQ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;912f6180-1aad-424e-9261-13632d628c8f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYEsUb2y2QoaihVx8GYQlLKUogMb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YEsUb2y2QoaihVx8GYQlLKUogMb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:206069,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;912f6180-1aad-424e-9261-13632d628c8f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYEsUb2y2QoaihVx8GYQlLKUogMb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YEsUb2y2QoaihVx8GYQlLKUogMb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:206069,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5369\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5369\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5369\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/16bbac5f-b4c2-4a2d-b748-b404bebb9fe2.png\" alt=\"Ph\u00ed FBA v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch t\u00ednh\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/16bbac5f-b4c2-4a2d-b748-b404bebb9fe2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/16bbac5f-b4c2-4a2d-b748-b404bebb9fe2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/16bbac5f-b4c2-4a2d-b748-b404bebb9fe2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/16bbac5f-b4c2-4a2d-b748-b404bebb9fe2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/16bbac5f-b4c2-4a2d-b748-b404bebb9fe2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5369\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Ph\u00ed FBA v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch t\u00ednh<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"MzWzdmJ4GozQ4txZTxzlqYUkg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EzxVd62bgo0IaSxgHdhlZlQKg2c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chi ph\u00ed FBA l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i to\u00e1n ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p. C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed ch\u00ednh bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZsR0dXD3koDemLxAXJnl6CibgYz\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ph\u00ed ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng (Fulfillment Fees)<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtGPdXVoAooeoaxcPH9l9bL6gOe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u00ed cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, bao g\u1ed3m chi ph\u00ed l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. Ph\u00ed n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 tr\u1ecdng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GNfGdpCZCoFjWzxmrIwlRsdXgFf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ph\u00ed l\u01b0u kho (Storage Fees)<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OpSSd1IHfokzLmxz7UFlXc3qgvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean th\u1ec3 t\u00edch trung b\u00ecnh m\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n chi\u1ebfm trong kho c\u1ee7a Amazon.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PPQkdjGtvoflTcxMjsulWLeOgwh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed kh\u00e1c<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OdNodUgCYoAXXmxq6OYlSrdug3e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 th\u00eam c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed nh\u01b0 ph\u00ed x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u1ea3 v\u1ec1, ph\u00ed l\u01b0u kho d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n, ph\u00ed d\u00e1n nh\u00e3n, ph\u00ed ti\u00eau h\u1ee7y h\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n&#8230;<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-C70XdAZXZo44TCxMiNXlavjYg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p (FAQs)<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MwPsd2XbFoWjHVxKBTAlgf5KgIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Amazon FBA c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZJ5hd7oTZoKdjZxl20plhHeOgOd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00f3, FBA r\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi v\u00ec n\u00f3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf g\u00e1nh n\u1eb7ng v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh. Tuy nhi\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u k\u1ef9 v\u1ec1 chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ee7 bi\u00ean l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GeusdHxUlovTmrxoCanlRE1ngtd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>N\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p FBA v\u1edbi FBM kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NOnwdDoh2o0AbQxIxFWlKbyzgRb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3. Nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p: d\u00f9ng FBA cho c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u00e1n ch\u1ea1y v\u00e0 FBM cho c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u00e1n ch\u1eadm ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a chi ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EeWvdIdiLoLHwIxr58JlIR9UgCc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u00e0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 \u01b0\u1edbc t\u00ednh chi ph\u00ed FBA?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IwbwdFqlZoooYdxciPOl1qjjgFc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed l\u00e0 &#8220;<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/sellercentral.amazon.com\/hz\/fba\/profitabilitycalculator\/index?lang=en_US\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FBA Revenue Calculator<\/a><\/strong>&#8221; gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 \u01b0\u1edbc t\u00ednh c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QPdbdXcDOoOflJxNeVolyz96gMh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon FBA ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng quy m\u00f4 kinh doanh tr\u00ean Amazon m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Tuy nhi\u00ean, n\u00f3 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t con \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ch\u00f4ng gai.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VTkSd7vVDoG1YPxc8JTlWB2Cg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng v\u1edbi FBA \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u1ec1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00e1 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd chi ph\u00ed m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch th\u00f4ng minh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FG6YdhSvDolowuxbks5lB0sCg4d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u00e3y c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn gi\u1eefa l\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u00e0 r\u1ee7i ro \u0111\u1ec3 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh xem FBA c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho s\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n hay kh\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HjpEdkAfXoSsiHxPugylyswrgcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u00f2n th\u1eafc m\u1eafc v\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amzon, h\u00e3y li\u00ean h\u1ec7 Lemon Digital \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn th\u00eam nhi\u1ec1u th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GwlXdSa0JoSpBoxAGxglMqRCgzg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-POX7d7hcWowaogxyxMwlDhMcgxc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-By7XdLomVoZmDPxHarglsUxSg58\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RivndT4yDozkgIxEgdJl0D0Dgxf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A2T7dqhUOoe1dUxVGdJly3tzgQe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RSJPdbnsPoFTxfxAkewlyxm5gOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AtcPdwd0XoPANTxJBPblb2QAg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Khi kinh doanh tr\u00ean Amazon, vi\u1ec7c x\u1eed l\u00fd kho b\u00e3i v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t. \u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\u00e0y, Amazon \u0111\u00e3 cho ra \u0111\u1eddi FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon) &